menu "Mesh module SDK, signals"

    config MESH_SIG_OFFSET
        int "Where this SDK's signals start, above MAX_SIG"
        range 1000 60000
        default 1000
        help
            An Active Object of an app cannot publish, so every signal of
            mesh_sys.h is posted, in a range of this SDK's own: from
            MAX_SIG + this to the count the header lists (27). The app's own
            signals are free from MAX_SIG to MAX_SIG + 999, and the other
            module SDKs have a range of theirs above (Robotics 1100, Camera
            1200, F*CK 1300). Change it only to clear a clash with another
            library; the header holds the range to 16 bits.

endmenu
